Package: wall
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Wall Developers <wall@example.invalid>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/mdmuntakim/wall
Description: Wall systems programming language toolchain
 Wall is a systems programming language that compiles to LLVM IR and
 ships its own assembler and static ELF linker.
 .
 This package installs the wall multicall driver, the merged libwall.so
 (compiler, assembler and linker), and the wallc, obasm, linker and
 ld.wall compatibility links in the Termux prefix.
